{"articleNo":"62702","sourceUrl":"https://www.kumoh.ac.kr/ko/sub06_01_01_03.do?mode=view&articleNo=62702&article.offset=0&articleLimit=10","title":"2012 U - Startup Contest 개최 공고( - 9.12)","writer":"국립금오공과대학교","writeDate":"2012.08.27","hit":"3620","attachments":[{"name":"[붙임4]+교육관련+창업아이디어_신청서[1].hwp","href":"https://www.kumoh.ac.kr/ko/sub06_01_01_03.do?mode=download&articleNo=62702&attachNo=70723"},{"name":"[붙임1-3]_2012_대학창업_경진대회_시행_공고문.hwp","href":"https://www.kumoh.ac.kr/ko/sub06_01_01_03.do?mode=download&articleNo=62702&attachNo=70827"}],"contentHtml":"\n                \t\n\t\t\t\t\t\n                \n                \t\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<p>&nbsp;</p><p style=\"MARGIN-RIGHT: 10pt\" class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt\">학생창업과 기술창업의 원천인 대학의 지원과 협력을 통해 성장한 </span><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: '휴먼명조,한컴돋움'; LETTER-SPACING: 0.8pt; FONT-SIZE: 12pt\">회사를 발굴 및 성공사례를 확산함으로써 대학창업 분위기를 조성하고, </span><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: '휴먼명조,한컴돋움'; LETTER-SPACING: 0.6pt; FONT-SIZE: 12pt\">창업 후 재기사례와 교육관련 창업 아이디어 발굴 중 다양한 수요를 </span><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: '휴먼명조,한컴돋움'; LETTER-SPACING: 0.8pt; FONT-SIZE: 12pt\">충족시키고자 </span><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: '휴먼명조,한컴돋움'; LETTER-SPACING: 0.8pt; FONT-SIZE: 12pt\">『2012 U(University) - Startup Contest』</span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt\">를 개최하오니 우리대학 학생들의 많은 관심과 참여 바랍니다</span>.</p><p style=\"MARGIN-RIGHT: 10pt\" class=\"HStyle0\">&nbsp;</p><p class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: '한컴바탕'\"><!--StartFragment-->&nbsp;</span></p><p class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Dotum, 돋움\">□ </span><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Dotum, 돋움; FONT-SIZE: 12pt\">추진배경</span></span></p><p style=\"MARGIN-TOP: 2pt; TEXT-INDENT: -29.6pt; MARGIN-BOTTOM: 2pt; MARGIN-LEFT: 29.6pt\" class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Dotum, 돋움\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt\">&nbsp;○ </span></span></span><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: Dotum, 돋움; LETTER-SPACING: 0.7pt; FONT-SIZE: 12pt\">최근 각종 창업경진대회를 통해 우수한 사업 아이디어(아이템)들이 발굴</span><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: Dotum, 돋움; LETTER-SPACING: 0.4pt; FONT-SIZE: 12pt\">되고 있으나, 실제 창업(Startup)으로 이어지는 사례는 소수에 불과</span></p><p style=\"MARGIN-TOP: 2pt; TEXT-INDENT: -29.4pt; MARGIN-BOTTOM: 2pt; MARGIN-LEFT: 29.4pt\" class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Dotum, 돋움\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt\">&nbsp;</span></span></span><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: '휴먼명조,한컴돋움'; FONT-SIZE: 12pt\"><span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Dotum, 돋움\">&nbsp;○ </span></span></span></span><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: Dotum, 돋움; LETTER-SPACING: 0.8pt; FONT-SIZE: 12pt\">학생창업과 기술창업의 원천인 </span><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: Dotum, 돋움; LETTER-SPACING: 0.8pt; FONT-SIZE: 12pt\">대학의 지원과 협력을 통해 성장한 회사를 발굴</span><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: Dotum, 돋움; LETTER-SPACING: 0.8pt; FONT-SIZE: 12pt\">하고 이들의 성공사례를 확산함으로써 대학창업 분위기를 조성</span></p><p style=\"MARGIN-TOP: 2pt; TEXT-INDENT: -28.2pt; MARGIN-BOTTOM: 2pt; MARGIN-LEFT: 28.2pt\" class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Dotum, 돋움\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt\">&nbsp;○ 특히, 창업 성공사례 이외에 실패 후 </span></span></span><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: Dotum, 돋움; FONT-SIZE: 12pt\">재기사례</span><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: Dotum, 돋움; FONT-SIZE: 12pt\">와 </span><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: Dotum, 돋움; FONT-SIZE: 12pt\">교육 관련 창업 아이디어를 발굴</span><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: Dotum, 돋움; FONT-SIZE: 12pt\">함으로써 창업문화 조성과 관련된 다양한 수요를 충족</span></p><p style=\"MARGIN-TOP: 2pt; TEXT-INDENT: -28.2pt; MARGIN-BOTTOM: 2pt; MARGIN-LEFT: 28.2pt\" class=\"HStyle0\">&nbsp;</p><p style=\"MARGIN-TOP: 2pt; TEXT-INDENT: -28.2pt; MARGIN-BOTTOM: 2pt; MARGIN-LEFT: 28.2pt\" class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: Dotum, 돋움; FONT-SIZE: 12pt\"><!--StartFragment-->&nbsp;</span></p><p class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: 'HY견명조'; FONT-SIZE: 18pt\">2012 U-Startup Contest 세부계획</span></p><p style=\"TEXT-INDENT: -29.7pt; MARGIN-LEFT: 29.7pt; MARGIN-RIGHT: 10pt\" class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: '휴먼명조,한컴돋움'; LETTER-SPACING: 0.3pt; FONT-SIZE: 5pt\"><br></span></p><p style=\"MARGIN-TOP: 2pt; MARGIN-BOTTOM: 2pt\" class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: 'HY견고딕'; FONT-SIZE: 15pt\">1. 경쟁부문 및 신청자격</span></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 145%; MARGIN-TOP: 2pt; MARGIN-BOTTOM: 2pt\" class=\"HStyle0\"><font color=\"#0900ff\"><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 145%; FONT-FAMILY: 'HY견고딕'; COLOR: #0000ff; FONT-SIZE: 14pt\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Dotum, 돋움; FONT-SIZE: 12pt\">교육관련 창업아이디어 기획 부문</span></span><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 145%; FONT-FAMILY: Dotum, 돋움; COLOR: #0000ff; FONT-SIZE: 12pt\"> &lt;개인 및 팀&gt;</span></font></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 145%; MARGIN-TOP: 2pt; TEXT-INDENT: -29.1pt; MARGIN-LEFT: 29.1pt\" class=\"HStyle0\"><font color=\"#0900ff\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Dotum, 돋움\">&nbsp;○ 내용: </span></span><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 145%; FONT-FAMILY: Dotum, 돋움; LETTER-SPACING: 0.4pt; COLOR: #0000ff; FONT-SIZE: 12pt\">교육과 관련하여 발생되는 사회문제 해결, 교육시장을 대상으로 </span><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 145%; FONT-FAMILY: Dotum, 돋움; LETTER-SPACING: -1.1pt; COLOR: #0000ff; FONT-SIZE: 12pt\">경제적 가치창출과 연계된 창의적</span><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 145%; FONT-FAMILY: Dotum, 돋움; LETTER-SPACING: 0.7pt; COLOR: #0000ff; FONT-SIZE: 12pt\">이고 체계적인 창업기획 아이디어를 선</span><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 145%; FONT-FAMILY: Dotum, 돋움; COLOR: #0000ff; FONT-SIZE: 12pt\">정</span></font></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 145%; TEXT-INDENT: -28.6pt; MARGIN-BOTTOM: 2pt; MARGIN-LEFT: 28.6pt\" class=\"HStyle0\"><font color=\"#0900ff\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Dotum, 돋움\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; * 아이디어 예시</span></span><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 145%; FONT-FAMILY: Dotum, 돋움; LETTER-SPACING: -1pt; COLOR: #0000ff; FONT-SIZE: 12pt\">: 학내 집단 따돌림 감지시스템</span><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 145%; FONT-FAMILY: Dotum, 돋움; LETTER-SPACING: -1.7pt; COLOR: #0000ff; FONT-SIZE: 12pt\"> 등</span></font></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 145%; MARGIN-TOP: 2pt; MARGIN-BOTTOM: 2pt\" class=\"HStyle0\"><font color=\"#0900ff\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Dotum, 돋움\">&nbsp;</span></span><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 145%; FONT-FAMILY: Dotum, 돋움; COLOR: #0000ff; FONT-SIZE: 12pt\">&nbsp;○ 신청분야: 교육과 관련하여 </span><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 145%; FONT-FAMILY: Dotum, 돋움; LETTER-SPACING: 0.4pt; COLOR: #0000ff; FONT-SIZE: 12pt\">분야 제한은 없음(단, 기 사업화되었거나</span></font></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 145%; MARGIN-TOP: 2pt; MARGIN-BOTTOM: 2pt\" class=\"HStyle0\"><font color=\"#0900ff\"><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 145%; FONT-FAMILY: Dotum, 돋움; LETTER-SPACING: 0.4pt; COLOR: #0000ff; FONT-SIZE: 12pt\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; 타 경진대회에서 수상한 아이템(아이디어)은 제외)</span><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 145%; FONT-FAMILY: Dotum, 돋움; COLOR: #0000ff; FONT-SIZE: 12pt\"> </span></font></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 145%; MARGIN-TOP: 2pt; TEXT-INDENT: -28.4pt; MARGIN-BOTTOM: 2pt; MARGIN-LEFT: 28.4pt\" class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Dotum, 돋움\"><font color=\"#0900ff\">&nbsp;○ 고려사항: 신청과제의 창의성 등 </font></span></span></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 145%; MARGIN-TOP: 2pt; TEXT-INDENT: -28.4pt; MARGIN-BOTTOM: 2pt; MARGIN-LEFT: 28.4pt\" class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Dotum, 돋움\"><!--StartFragment--><font color=\"#0900ff\">&nbsp;<!--StartFragment--> </font></span></span></p><p style=\"MARGIN-TOP: 3pt; TEXT-INDENT: -29.4pt; MARGIN-LEFT: 29.4pt\" class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: 'HY견고딕'; COLOR: #0000ff; FONT-SIZE: 14pt\">&lt;교육관련 창업 아이디어 기획 부문 &gt;</span></p><p style=\"MARGIN-TOP: 3pt; TEXT-INDE